From 3bdc2ce6d4ba6e38f710967ed5d683525dee5d6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <dev@infoverify.local>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 17:23:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Give Birth Attestation and Newspaper Publication a full admin
 review page

Upgrades both from the simple complete+download-PDF action pair to the
same rich 'manage' page pattern already established by cac.ts - a
dedicated page (not a single AdminJS confirm-guard action) where an
admin can see every submitted detail, leave a progress note visible to
the customer while still PENDING, and separately attach the real final
document to complete the request.

- birth-attestation.service.ts: new updateBirthAttestationProgressNotes()
  (identical shape to cac.service.ts's updateCacProgressNotes());
  completeBirthAttestation() now takes attestationPdfBase64 and merges
  it into the sealed PII via mergeSealedPII() instead of just flipping
  status with no attached document.
- newspaper-publication.service.ts: same two changes -
  updateNewspaperPublicationProgressNotes() +
  completeNewspaperPublication() now takes publicationPdfBase64 (the
  scanned cutting/affidavit).
- admin/birth-attestation.ts: rewritten from a bare PDF-stream route
  into a full manage page (mirrors admin/cac.ts) - shows the applicant's
  uploaded ID photo inline, every field in a detail table, a downloadable
  auto-generated submission form, the progress-notes textarea, and a
  file input to upload the final NPC attestation document to complete.
- admin/newspaper-publication.ts: same shape, with Old Details / New
  Details tables instead of one flat list.
- transaction.resource.ts: replaced the completeX/downloadXPdf action
  pairs for both types with single manageBirthAttestation/
  manageNewspaperPublication actions (mirrors manageCacRequest exactly);
  redirect-to-manage.tsx's TARGET_PATH_BY_TYPE updated from /pdf to
  /manage for both.

Verified: all 173 existing backend tests still pass unchanged (vitest
run). Backend tsc shows only the same pre-existing stale-Prisma-client
error class already present on bvn-modification.service.ts/cac.service
.ts (16 of the same errors there, 203 total repo-wide) - this sandbox
still can't reach binaries.prisma.sh to refresh the cached client;
running prisma generate locally clears these as always. Frontend
untouched by this change; tsc/install still clean.
